---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ProjectCarousel from "../components/projects/ProjectsCarousel.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="w-full">
    <section class="w-full py-24 bg-slate-50 px-6">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <span
          class="text-brand-primary font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-sm mb-2 block"
        >
          Research Area
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-secondary mb-6">
          Computational Modeling of Emotion & Affective HCI
        </h1>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-slate-700 font-medium mb-8">
          Bridging the gap between human emotion and technology
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Our primary objective is to translate our understanding of human emotion
          into computational algorithms. We formalize psychological and neuroscientific 
          frameworks (e.g., appraisal theory, which explains how we assess events as good or bad)
          to build computational models that enable intelligent systems to exhibit plausible emotional 
          and social behaviors, and that provide a simulation testbed to validate theories regarding 
          human cognition (e.g., modeling the impact of anxiety on decision-making). Furthermore, 
          our work in Affective HCI focuses on creating adaptive systems that recognize user emotional
          states through multimodal sensing (focusing mainly on vulnerable populations such as People with Dementia) 
          to provide empathetic, personalized assistance.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ProjectCarousel title="Related Projects" filterTag="Affective" />

    <div class="h-16"></div>

  </main>
</Layout>